{
  "mn52:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 52 ",
  "mn52:0.2": "Aṭṭhakanāgarasutta ",
  "mn52:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn52:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ āyasmā ānando vesāliyaṁ viharati beluvagāmake. ",
  "mn52:1.3": "Tena kho pana samayena dasamo gahapati aṭṭhakanāgaro pāṭaliputtaṁ anuppatto hoti kenacideva karaṇīyena. ",
  "mn52:2.1": "Atha kho dasamo gahapati aṭṭhakanāgaro yena kukkuṭārāmo yena aññataro bhikkhu tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā taṁ bhikkhuṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho dasamo gahapati aṭṭhakanāgaro taṁ bhikkhuṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn52:2.2": "“kahaṁ nu kho, bhante, āyasmā ānando etarahi viharati? ",
  "mn52:2.3": "Dassanakāmā hi mayaṁ taṁ āyasmantaṁ ānandan”ti. ",
  "mn52:2.4": "“Eso, gahapati, āyasmā ānando vesāliyaṁ viharati beluvagāmake”ti. ",
  "mn52:3.1": "Atha kho dasamo gahapati aṭṭhakanāgaro pāṭaliputte taṁ karaṇīyaṁ tīretvā yena vesālī yena beluvagāmako yenāyasmā ānando tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā āyasmantaṁ ānandaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho dasamo gahapati aṭṭhakanāgaro āyasmantaṁ ānandaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn52:3.2": "“atthi nu kho, bhante ānanda, tena bhagavatā jānatā passatā arahatā sammāsambuddhena ekadhammo akkhāto yattha bhikkhuno appamattassa ātāpino pahitattassa viharato avimuttañceva cittaṁ vimuccati, aparikkhīṇā ca āsavā parikkhayaṁ gacchanti, ananuppattañca anuttaraṁ yoga